{"v":4,"catch":"期待不尋常的驚喜！","desc":"《PAC-LAND》是NAMCO（BANDAI NAMCO Entertainment Inc.）於1984年發行的橫向捲軸動作遊戲。\n標題跟隨 PAC-MAN 尋求將迷失的仙女帶回仙境。\nPAC-MAN 離開小鎮，穿過山林，會遇到什麼奇怪的事情？ PAC-MAN 的迷人冒險從這裡開始！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-04-07","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7f6bcf5c34ef06216ab78a27ee8b9be5bbd8299ac39982748a52c04bbf569ade.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/26b9e2567ff5e5d8033e4acf76b991ffe385700302b6bcd78a0f79bcf142ad90.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7f23dcbc68140fa481d7b1b868b1dc3a9ebe24fcbddcc18620745a4b4a175725.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e96bd0a88fdbe7d3ab938c20de22e887c1d331d326ea171108cf6fe76f76802b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7935912d456452cc22122e37eb3b98855d78c50a6362d05b2b79ef6173528e08.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c2d412857f0b3594bda894520998788d9ba823090444b0437e01ac4a239b02ae.jpg"],"titleId":"0100cf20178d0000","dlc":[]}